				"&8• Lossy overclocked machines: limit is 1 tick (1t)"
				"&8• Lossless overclocked machine: limit is less than 4 ticks (<4t)"
				"After reaching this limit, continuing to overclock will result in parallel compensation:"
				"&8• Lossy overclocked machine: power consumption becomes 4 times, parallelism becomes 2 times"
				"&8• Lossless overclocked machine: energy consumption becomes 4 times, parallelism becomes 4 times"
				""
				"&lAfter testing, the upper limit of parallel compensation is 2147483647."
				"Currently known applicable machines include: electric blast furnace, alloy smelting furnace, vacuum drying furnace (vacuum drying mode)."
